{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DogPunk is a sci-fi shooter set in a distant future where companies rush to create cutting-edge weapons to arm themselves and hurt others. In this high-octane first-person shooter, the player is a dog-headed super soldier trying to escape from containment by their captor, the Lab by Predator Tec. Battle through trials with various environments and enemies, and maneuver your character with the fluid parkour system.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Parkour Movement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/dpParkourGif\u2014\u2014\u4f7f\u7528Clipchamp\u5236\u4f5c.gif?t=1747018611\" />\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move and dodge around enemy fire using movement abilities such as double jump, wall run, and grappling hook.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Weapons</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/dpLevelGif.gif?t=1747018611\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilize two weapons and combat abilities that give you an edge over the enemies. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/dpAbilityGif\u2014\u2014\u4f7f\u7528Clipchamp\u5236\u4f5c.gif?t=1747018611\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your loadout and select from 10 different abilities, such as time dilation and gravitational surge, to fit your playstyle. Use them in tandem with your movement to outmaneuver your enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Levels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/dpWeaponGif\u2014\u2014\u4f7f\u7528Clipchamp\u5236\u4f5c.gif?t=1747018611\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle in over 15 randomized and diverse environments that require quick thinking and reflexes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/dpEnemyGif\u2014\u2014\u4f7f\u7528Clipchamp\u5236\u4f5c.gif?t=1747018611\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage with enemies on both the ground and air, with various modifiers such as dodge and shield that bring new challenges.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3665510?t=1747018611","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3665510?t=1747018611","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/4103e27baa2d25d2185e9297d5205549359cc1d4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747018611","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/4103e27baa2d25d2185e9297d5205549359cc1d4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747018611","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DogPunk is a sci-fi shooter set in a distant future where companies rush to create cutting-edge weapons to arm themselves and hurt others. In this high-octane first-person shooter, the player is a dog-headed super soldier trying to escape from containment by their 